{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_bdrk_gmfprercaw7eqx4gd5lrrvafkulp3jgsn3dyj3pgvkiotkqdtbna","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_014xMmMtMMSvnu6we493d3aX","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-n48Iqv/translated_rust/tests/exe_diff.rs","old_string":"///   * `FAR_FATAL_MIN ..= SIGNAL_KIND_UNSTABLE_MIN` — reproducibly `SIGSEGV`\n///     (20/20 runs under empty, minimal and inherited environments), so exact\n///     equality of signal *and* stdout is asserted.\n///   * above that — `4 * k` is multiple gigabytes and ASLR decides whether the\n///     fault is `SIGSEGV` or `SIGBUS` (C measured at 33% `SIGBUS` for\n///     `i32::MAX`), so only \"died from a fatal signal with no output\" is\n///     asserted. Pinning the signal number there would be asserting against C's\n///     own coin flip.","new_string":"///   * `FAR_FATAL_MIN ..= SIGNAL_KIND_UNSTABLE_MIN` — reproducibly `SIGSEGV`\n///     (240/240 random samples, and 20/20 per fixed index under empty, minimal\n///     and inherited environments), so exact equality of signal *and* stdout is\n///     asserted.\n///   * above that — ASLR decides whether the fault is `SIGSEGV` or `SIGBUS`\n///     (one `SIGBUS` in 120 samples already at k ≈ 2.8e7, rising to 33% at\n///     `i32::MAX`), so only \"died from a fatal signal with no output\" is\n///     asserted. Pinning the signal number there would be asserting against C's\n///     own coin flip."}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4441,"cache_read_input_tokens":200480,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4441,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6de6788a-c8a8-4554-8fe2-4313825db3b2","uuid":"59b2fcd3-aae8-4f5c-bf27-6adb1760bc24","timestamp